Copyright 2026 icetomoyo <icetomoyo@gmail.com> <icetomoyo@163.com>

This product includes software developed by icetomoyo.

KodaX Space is the Electron desktop client for the KodaX ecosystem
(see https://github.com/icetomoyo/KodaX). It consumes the public
`@kodax-ai/kodax` package and its documented public subpath exports.
Coder uses the profile-scoped KodaX Runtime daemon while Partner and
explicit host-provider integrations remain in the Electron main process.
KodaX Space ships independently of any closed-source KodaX-private
components.
